/E (A comprehensive systematic review conducted in 2025 examined global forecasting models across endemic regions, synthesizing evidence from institutions including Diponegoro University, Mahidol University, and Universiti Sains Malaysia. The review demonstrated that machine learning algorithms, particularly Random Forest and Long Short-Term Memory networks, frequently outperform conventional time-series models such as ARIMA and SARIMA in predictive accuracy as measured by RMSE, MAE, and MAPE metrics. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
