/E (The dengue surveillance dataset contained three missing values occurring within a single observation corresponding to Gampaha district in March 2019. As the missing values were confined to one row, this observation was excluded from the analysis. To reduce the influence of short-term fluctuations and missing monthly data, monthly dengue case counts were not directly summed. Instead, average monthly dengue cases were calculated for each district for the years 2019, 2020, and 2021.)
